  "limitations": "One active mission at a time, strictly in validated order. No branching choices, cut-scenes or failure by damage. Escape completes when stars return to 0 after being above 0 during the mission. Collect counts collect events of any item.",
  "port_notes": "Original state machine by Skillpack contributors. Order = repeated choice of the first mission (input order) whose prerequisites are done (stable topological order). Time-limit failure resets the mission timer and progress and counts a failure.",
  "flow_role": "Step 6 (görevler): build missions from the map landmarks (G002), validate the chain, check every target tile is reachable by car (G005 on the drive grid), and replay a scripted run; the validated list goes into the HTML (G012)."
